repeat_over_text.plain, line 2, while running: Say which parts of the text to go through: its characters, its words or its lines.

    repeat for each guest in guests
                             ^^^^^^
Try one of these:
    repeat for each guest in the words of guests
  or
    repeat for each guest in the characters of guests
  or
    repeat for each guest in the lines of guests
Why: Text isn't a list, so Plain needs to know which parts you mean.
